# Carlo Gavazzi EM530 and EM540 energy analysers (RS485).
# FC03 and FC04 return the same values; this map reads everything as holding registers.
# Tables 4.1 and 4.2 of the protocol hold the same values at two addresses; the second copy is in the group "By phase (copy)".
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Carlo Gavazzi
@model=EM530 / EM540
@vendor_website=gavazziautomation.com
@description=Three-phase energy analysers with RS485 (EM530 and EM540, standard and MID PFA/PFB/PFC). Some setup registers are read-only or missing on MID and AV2 models
@source=Carlo Gavazzi, "EM530/EM540 Modbus communication protocol", public version 1.3 (2024-02-13), tables 4.1-4.24; https://www.gavazziautomation.com/fileadmin/images/PIM/OTHERSTUFF/COMPRO/EM500_CPP_Mod_V1.3_13022024.pdf
@protocol=rtu
@unit_id=1
@baudrate=9600
@parity=N
@databits=8
@stopbits=1
@byte_order=CDAB
@address_base=0
@max_read_registers=20
@enum_phase_sequence=-1=L1-L3-L2|1=L1-L2-L3
@enum_load_type=-1=C (capacitive)|1=L (inductive)
@enum_model_code=1744=EM530 X|1745=EM530 PFA|1746=EM530 PFB|1747=EM530 PFC|1760=EM540 X|1761=EM540 PFA|1762=EM540 PFB|1763=EM540 PFC
@enum_page_filter=0=No filter|1=Filter|2=Screen saver

